            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Table 5: MIA-scFM dose-response in the controlled re-pretraining experiment. Each row is a separate small-scFM training run on a known Genecorpus-30M held-in/held-out split. AUROC and TPR are computed against the ground-truth membership labels using the per-cell loss from Eq. 6 with K = 8 (mild) or K = 16 (aggressive) mask realizations.</div>\n",
