                [
                    123.0,
                    1347.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We conclude that naive dataset-level ASW comparisons cannot reliably attribute differences to contamination, and the field should adopt design-based approaches (within-cell-type, donor-matched) as in the next subsection.",
